    "group": "Nemesor Zahndrekh",
    "summary": "While this model leads a unit, as [your Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) begins, roll a D6; the weapons that unit's models carry get the ability for the result until [your next Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase):\n\n- **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)** on a 1-2\n- **[[LETHAL HITS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/lethal-hits)** on a 3-4\n- **[[DEVASTATING WOUNDS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/devastating-wounds)** on a 5-6",
